  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Dr. Wael Khoury built a medical career in cardiology through training at the University of Damascus, Cleveland hospitals, and Case Western Reserve University. His work included Marymount Hospital leadership, Cleveland Clinic roles, clinical research, and service with Arab American, Syrian, medical, and international-affairs organizations in Northeast Ohio."
